# Public HTTPS origin → Literature Zotero MCP. Caddy terminates TLS and preserves
# the Host header, which the server's DNS-rebinding guard requires.
# {$LITERATURE_ZOTERO_MCP_DOMAIN} comes from .env.
# For a DuckDNS hostname, use the DNS-01 challenge — build a Caddy image with the
# duckdns module, or use a custom cert. See docs/deployment.md.
{$LITERATURE_ZOTERO_MCP_DOMAIN} {
	encode zstd gzip
	reverse_proxy literature-zotero-mcp:3939
}
